{'symbol': 'FFIV', 'date': '2023-04-19 16:35:00', 'title': 'F5 REPORTS 11% SECOND QUARTER FISCAL YEAR 2023 REVENUE GROWTH; COMPANY PRIORITIZING HIGH-IMPACT INITIATIVES WHILE REDUCING OPERATING COSTS', 'text': "SEATTLE--(BUSINESS WIRE)--F5, INC. (NASDAQ: FFIV) TODAY ANNOUNCED FINANCIAL RESULTS FOR ITS SECOND QUARTER OF FISCAL YEAR 2023. “WE DELIVERED 11% REVENUE GROWTH IN OUR SECOND QUARTER AS A RESULT OF STRONGER THAN EXPECTED SYSTEMS SHIPMENTS AND STRONG GLOBAL SERVICES PERFORMANCE,” SAID FRANÇOIS LOCOH-DONOU, F5'S PRESIDENT AND CEO."}